      {
        "id": 115782,
        "name": "SeraAlexandria",
        "username": "SeraAlexandria",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-22T01:18:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Okay, so Hypothetical question:If Tachyon had a Power Card with a hazard attack, and had it in play and did Hypersonic, she could use that Hazard attack against enemies, since it would be an active attack?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>She couldn't because the card specifies that you activate it without paying its costs. Players cannot activate hazard attacks. Hazard attacks trigger under specified situations. They also don't have costs. If Tachyon got an attack that cost health, she could activate that one hypothetically though.</p>",
